0:{"buildId":"UWGfTDAVxkhJThU2py1Gd","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"title":"Custom Styling","description":"Apply custom CSS to JavaScript SDK slots.","content":"## CSS Classes\n\nAdkit adds these classes to slot elements:\n\n```css\n.adkit-slot { }\n.adkit-slot--loading { }\n.adkit-slot--empty { }\n.adkit-slot--filled { }\n```\n\n## Custom Styles\n\n```css\n.adkit-slot {\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.adkit-slot--empty {\n  background: #f5f5f5;\n}\n```\n\nContent coming soon.","slug":"js/custom-styling"}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/10623e2afbf6a84c.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
